IncreaseTest
├── when caller is not authorized
│ └── it reverts with {NotAuthorizedForToken}
├── when deadline has passed
│ └── it reverts with {DeadlinePassed}
├── when minLiquidityAdded is not met
│ └── it reverts with {InsufficientLiquidity}
├── given caller is owner
│ ├── when the position has liquidity
│ │ └── it grows the same tokenId and leaves the zap idle
│ ├── when the position is emptied
│ │ └── it refills the same tokenId
│ └── when the pool is native
│     └── it grows the same tokenId and leaves the zap idle
└── given caller is an operator
    └── it forces dust to the owner
